Package: ros-jazzy-qrb-camera-platform-config
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, plugin-discovery (>= 0.3.0)
Conflicts: plugin-discovery-platform-config
Description: plugin_discovery camera configuration for IQ9 and IQ10 on Ubuntu
 Platform configuration candidates of the camera domain: qmmf on IQ9 (QCS9075),
 qcarcam on IQ10 (QAM8797P). platform-detect links the one matching the machine
 into /etc/plugin_discovery/platform.d/.
